"""
This script submits ORCA jobs to a SLURM scheduler.

It parses the ORCA input file, adjusts settings as specified,
generates a SLURM script, and submits the job.

Usage:
    qorca [options] input_file

Author:
    Markus G. S. Weiss
Date:
    2024-11-18
"""

